{"rank": 158, "root": "وهب", "form": 1, "lemma": "وَهَبَ", "count": 22, "ayahCount": 21, "share": 0.11, "meaning": {"bs": "darovati, pokloniti", "en": "to give, to grant", "tr": "vermek, bahşetmek", "fr": "donner, accorder", "id": "memberi, menganugerahkan", "ur": "عطا کرنا، بخشنا", "bn": "দান করা, প্রদান করা", "fa": "دادن، عطا کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/e5f8c02edcc041db553d.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-wahaba_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes wahaba_1-g{from{transform:translateX(-10px)}}@keyframes wahaba_1-c{from{transform:rotate(0)}}.va-wahaba_1 .a .ra{transform:rotate(-90deg)}.va-wahaba_1 .b .ra{transform:rotate(-90deg);animation:wahaba_1-c .7s ease-out .3s both}.va-wahaba_1 .gf{animation:wahaba_1-g 1s ease-in-out .8s both}.va-wahaba_1 .rb{fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:1.5}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-wahaba_1.off,.va-wahaba_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-wahaba_1,.va-wahaba_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><g class=\"a\"><g transform=\"translate(38 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></g><g class=\"b\" transform=\"matrix(-1 0 0 1 120 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(38 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\"