 bahşettik", "fr": "et Nous avons accordé", "id": "dan Kami menganugerahkan", "ur": "اور ہم نے عطا کیا", "bn": "এবং আমরা দান করলাম", "fa": "و بخشیدیم"}}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّحْمَتِنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَخَاهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَبِيًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "37:100", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3888.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "My Lord! Vouchsafe me of the righteous.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Ey Rabbim! Bana salihlerden (bir oğul) ihsan et!\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "الٰہی مجھے لائق اولاد دے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Ya Tuhanku, anugrahkanlah kepadaku (seorang anak) yang termasuk orang-orang yang saleh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "رَبِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَبْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6591c2a4e536307e1f75.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "daruj", "en": "grant", "tr": "bahşet", "fr": "accorde", "id": "anugerahkanlah", "ur": "عطا کر", "bn": "দান করো", "fa": "ببخش"}}, {"text": "لِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "26:21", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2953.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Then I fled from you when I feared you, and my Lord vouchsafed me a command and appointed me (of the number) of those sent (by Him).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Sizden korkunca da hemen aranızdan kaçtım. Sonra Rabbim bana hikmet bahşetti ve beni peygamberlerden kıldı.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو میں تمھا رے یہا ں سے نکل گیا جب کے تم سے ڈرا تو میرے رب نے مجھے حکم عطا فرمایا اور مجھے پیغمبروں سے کیا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Lalu aku lari meninggalkan kamu ketika aku takut kepadamu, kemudian Tuhanku memberikan kepadaku ilmu serta Dia menjadikanku salah seorang di antara rasul-rasul.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَفَرَرْتُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خِفْتُكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَوَهَبَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/3078e38568a9b4a53391.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so he/it gave", "bs": "pa je darovao", "tr": "böylece lütfetti", "fr": "alors il a fait un don", "id": "maka dia telah memberikan", "ur": "پس اُس نے دیا", "bn": "অতএব সে দান করল", "fa": "پس عطا کرد"}}, {"text": "لِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حُكْمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَجَعَلَنِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "19:19", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2269.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: I am only a messenger of thy Lord, that I may bestow on thee a faultless son.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Melek: \"Ben, sana temiz bir oğlan bağışlamak için, Rabbinin gönderdiği bir elçiyim\" dedi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بولا میں تیرے رب کا بھیجا ہوا ہوں، کہ میں تجھے ایک ستھرا بیٹا دوں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Ia (jibril) berkata: \"Sesungguhnya aku ini hanyalah seorang utusan Tuhanmu, untuk memberimu seorang anak laki-laki yang suci\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّمَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَا۠", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَسُولُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّكِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِأَهَبَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/959aa424ca432d52091d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "da darujem", "en": "that I may give", "tr": "bahşetmem için", "fr": "afin que je donne", "id": "agar aku memberi", "ur": "تاکہ میں عطا کروں", "bn": "যাতে আমি দান করি", "fa": "تا ببخشم"}}, {"text": "لَكِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غُلَٰمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "زَكِيًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَوَهَبْنَا", "count": 8, "first": "6:84", "audio": "audio/8cabd0ce2882497ad7ee.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "i darovali smo", "en": "and We granted", "tr": "ve bahşettik", "fr": "et Nous avons accordé", "id": "dan Kami menganugerahkan", "ur": "اور ہم نے عطا کیا", "bn": "এবং আমরা দান করলাম", "fa": "و بخشیدیم"}}, {"arabic": "هَبْ", "count": 4, "first": "3:38", "audio": "audio/6591c2a4e536307e1f75.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "daruj", "en": "grant", "tr": "bahşet", "